  howToPlay:
  - title: Walk and look
    body: 'WASD or the left stick to walk, the mouse or the right stick to look.
      Shift (LB) to hurry.

      E (X) looks at something properly, or talks to
      someone.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: The journal
    body: 'J, Tab or (View) opens Nadia''s notebook. Click an entry to read and pick
      it; pick two and Combine: if they fit, they make something new.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Arguments
    body: 'Move the small light with WASD or the stick and keep it out of the way.
      Things you''ve worked out drift into the box: touch one to say it.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
